# Overview
ietf-hardware-state module for netconfd, Raspberry Pi implementation.

Reports the following /hardware components (RFC 8348 ietf-hardware-state):

 * raspberry-pi  - ianahw:container, serial number and model read from the device tree
 * temperature   - ianahw:sensor, Sensirion STS3x on I2C (/dev/i2c-1, address 0x4a),
                   celsius, value-scale milli
 * pm1, pm25, pm10 - ianahw:sensor, Plantower PMS7003 on UART (/dev/serial0),
                   atmospheric ug/m3 multiplied by 1000, value-scale milli

The sensors are read in-process when /hardware is retrieved. If a sensor can not be
read its <sensor-data> is reported with <oper-status>unavailable</oper-status>.

# Wiring
 STS3x:   SDA -> GPIO 2, SCL -> GPIO 3 (i2c1)
 PMS7003: TX  -> GPIO 15 (RXD, /dev/serial0), 5V, GND

# Raspberry Pi configuration
/boot/firmware/config.txt:
 dtparam=i2c_arm=on
 enable_uart=1

Make sure the serial console is not enabled on /dev/serial0
(no console=serial0,... in /boot/firmware/cmdline.txt).

The serial device can be overridden with the PMS7003_DEVICE environment variable.

# Dependencies
Installed netconfd and yangcli
 apt-get install netconfd yangcli libyuma-dev

# Installation
 autoreconf -i -f
 ./configure CFLAGS="-g -O0"  CXXFLAGS="-g -O0" --prefix=/usr
 make
 make install

# Testing installation

 netconfd --module=ietf-hardware-state --no-startup --superuser=$USER

Other terminal:
 yangcli --server=localhost --user=$USER

yangcli pi@localhost> xget /hardware
...
  data {
    hardware {
      last-change 2026-08-18T16:30:00Z
      component raspberry-pi {
        name raspberry-pi
        class ianahw:container
        serial-num 000000008c18491c
        mfg-name 'Raspberry Pi'
        model-name 'Zero 2 W Rev 1.0'
      }
      component temperature {
        name temperature
        class ianahw:sensor
        parent raspberry-pi
        sensor-data {
          value 23450
          value-type celsius
          value-scale milli
          value-precision 2
          oper-status ok
          value-timestamp 2026-08-18T16:31:02Z
          value-update-rate 0
          units-display 'milli degrees'
        }
      }
      component pm1 {
        name pm1
        class ianahw:sensor
        parent raspberry-pi
        sensor-data {
          value 3000
          value-type other
          value-scale milli
          value-precision 2
          oper-status ok
          value-timestamp 2026-08-18T16:31:02Z
          value-update-rate 0
          units-display 'PM1 particles'
        }
      }
      component pm25 {
        ...
      }
      component pm10 {
        ...
      }
    }
  }
